  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of the Labor Inclusion of Migrants, Returnees and Host Communities in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project contributes to increase the level of economic income of Venezuelan migrants residing in Colombia, refugees and Colombian migrants returned to their territory, strengthening the capacities of employment centers and other entities that have employment services and articulating the work of this services to the private sector needs, in alliance with civil society, academia and other organizations that promote employability in each of the prioritized geographic areas.</narrative>
  </description>
